								<div id="contentForThisGame_ctn">
				</div>
									<div data-panel="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;PanelGroup&quot;}" id="aboutThisGame" class="game_page_autocollapse" style="max-height: 850px;">
						<div id="game_area_description" class="game_area_description">
							<h2>About This Game</h2>
							<p class="bb_paragraph" >Max and Lyokha are ordinary 18-year-old graduates who, one day, have the misfortune of finding themselves in an abandoned building, accompanied only by their own curiosity.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >There, they discover a door that shouldn't exist. Beyond it lies a cave, mountains of treasure, and the ghost of Ali Baba, who makes a very convincing plea for them not to touch anything.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Max, naturally, touches something.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >His life instantly turns into a nightmare. A cursed ring begins to alter everything around him, ghosts demand the return of the stolen goods, and the ring itself somehow ends up with Varvara—a 17-year-old goth girl who is still attending kindergarten because she simply cannot pass the interview for first grade.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >But getting the ring back proves difficult. Varvara has no intention of handing it over without a fight and forces Max to undergo a series of trials. The further he progresses, the less his reality resembles a normal life.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Ghostly bandits, fanged centipedes, mutated hamsters, bizarre rituals, a parallel reality, a business-savvy chicken, a philosophizing octopus, and other utterly inexplicable phenomena await Max on his journey home.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Then there are the choices. Sometimes they help. Sometimes they make matters worse. And sometimes, they lead to a death so absurd that one can only ask: &quot;Why on earth did I choose that?&quot;</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >There is no safe way to navigate this entire adventure. However, there are countless ways to make it as bizarre as possible.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Welcome to a world where ancient curses collide with high school woes, ghosts bicker over mundane matters, and common sense handed in its resignation long ago. </p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >GAME FEATURES:</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >A comedic adventure featuring absurd humor and unexpected situations</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >An interactive story with choices that can lead to various consequences and endings</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >A series of crazy challenges, each potentially more dangerous than the last</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >A mystical tale involving a cursed ring, bandit ghosts, and ancient secrets</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Quirky characters: from a 17-year-old goth girl in kindergarten to a philosophizing octopus and a business-savvy chicken</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >A journey into a parallel reality where even an ordinary soccer ball can cause serious trouble</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Grotesque and absurd deaths determined by the player's choices</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >A story where it is nearly impossible to predict what will happen next</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >PLAYER WARNING</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >The game contains:</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Character deaths and numerous comedic ways to die</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Scenes of violence and threats of physical harm</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Weapons: sabers, daggers, and other items used in violent scenes</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Explosions and references to dynamite</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Forcible confinement and scenes of captivity</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Threats of human sacrifice and mystical rituals</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Ghosts, skeletons, skulls, and other mystical elements</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Grotesque descriptions of death and bodily humor; deaths involving dismemberment and depictions of internal organs</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Dark, crude, and occasionally toilet humor</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Profanity and coarse language</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >References to alcohol</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Scenes involving danger from fantastical creatures</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Smoking scenes, including depictions of characters smoking.</p>						</div>
					</div>
