			<h2>Mature Content Description</h2>
			<p>The developers describe the content like this:</p>
			<p><i>
			This game is intended exclusively for an adult audience (18+). We recommend exercising discretion.<br />
<br />
The game features scenes of smoking, as well as depictions of weapons and alcohol. It also includes scenes of murder and dismemberment, including acts of extreme violence, as well as threats of human sacrifice and mystical rituals.<br />
Set in a harsh and unforgiving criminal underworld, the game exposes players to graphic violence, including bloodshed, the use of weapons, killings, and interrogations involving physical force. The narrative also addresses themes of alcohol and sedative use and features encounters with characters suffering from drug addiction.<br />
<br />
All characters involved in adult-oriented scenes are fictional and are depicted as being at least 21 years of age.				</i>
			</p>
		</div>
